R3write — Beta License
=======================

Copyright (c) 2026 drknowhow. All rights reserved.

R3write is currently in beta. This document sets the terms on which the
app and its source code are made available during that period.


1. Free during beta
-------------------

During the beta period, R3write is FREE to download, install, and use for
personal and evaluation purposes on any number of your own machines, on
Windows 10 / 11.


2. Source visibility
--------------------

The source code is published on GitHub for transparency, learning, and
community contribution. It is NOT released under an open-source license
at this time. Publication does not grant any rights beyond those stated
in this document.


3. Future model
---------------

R3write may move to a one-time support payment per major version (for
example, 1.x → 2.x) once it exits beta. Any such change will be
announced before it takes effect. Beta users will continue to be able
to use the beta version free of charge, and prior major versions of
the app will continue to function without an active payment.


4. What you may do
------------------

- Download, install, and use R3write on your own machines, free during beta.
- Read, study, and learn from the published source.
- File issues, suggest features, and submit pull requests on GitHub.
- Build the app from source for personal use.
- Share screenshots, recordings, or reviews of R3write.


5. What you may not do (without prior written permission)
---------------------------------------------------------

- Redistribute the app, the installer, or modified builds.
- Sell, sublicense, or rent R3write or any derivative work.
- Use the source code as the basis for a product that competes with R3write.
- Remove, obscure, or alter the copyright notice, brand mark, or
  attribution in the app, installer, or source.
- Use the R3write name, logo, or brand in ways that imply endorsement
  or affiliation without permission.


6. Third-party AI providers
---------------------------

R3write connects directly to whichever AI provider you configure
(Local Ollama, Ollama Cloud, Google Gemini, OpenAI, Anthropic, Groq,
OpenRouter). Your API keys and the text you rewrite never pass through
any server controlled by R3write or its author. R3write provides no
proxy, no telemetry, and no analytics.

Your use of each provider is governed by that provider's own terms of
service and privacy policy. R3write is not responsible for provider
availability, accuracy, billing, or data handling.


7. No warranty
--------------

R3write is provided "AS IS", without warranty of any kind, express or
implied, including but not limited to warranties of merchantability,
fitness for a particular purpose, and non-infringement. In no event
shall the author be liable for any claim, damages, or other liability
arising from the use of R3write.


8. Contact
----------

Questions about this license, or requests for permission outside its
terms, can be filed as an issue on GitHub:

  https://github.com/drknowhow/R3write/issues
